                                                <h1 class='postTitle'>From Jannah to Jihad: The Islamic Theology of Frank Herbert’s Dune
                                                </h1>
                                                <div class='postMeta'>
                                                    <div class='postAuthorAndTimestamp'>
                                                        <span class='authorImage'>
                                                            <span class='hasImage'
                                                                data-style='https://www.evidentmonthly.in/storage/authors/01KE1W0HC60VRP9F5XHJGP3E14.png'></span>
